      "page": 434,
      "ruku": 375,
      "hizbQuarter": 174,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3657,
      "text": "If only you could see when they are stricken with terror, but there will be no escape, and they will be seized from a nearby place[25].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 434,
      "ruku": 375,
      "hizbQuarter": 174,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3658,
      "text": "They will say, “Now we believe in it,” but how could they attain faith from such a distant place[26],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 22,
